<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your flight to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b style=""><i><font size="2">-If did not receive change add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We were concerned to learn that the crew on board your flight&nbsp;QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} did not return your change before the end of the flight. You should receive prompt, correct service from all of our staff, and I would like to assure you that your experience was not the service we strive to deliver.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have spoken with our crew who have confirmed the mistake and would like to arrange a refund of the ${!Case.Recovery_Value__c} you are due. I have attached a form for you to provide your bank account details, so that we can process your refund. When returning the completed form, please reply to this email to ensure your information is attached to your current file and processed accordingly.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If unhappy have to pay add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a full service airline, food and non-alcoholic drinks are included on all our flights, with beer and wine served free of charge on selected services across our domestic and QantasLink network.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Complimentary beer and wine is served on Qantas flights between Adelaide, Brisbane, Canberra, Melbourne and Sydney departing after 4pm from Monday to Friday. On flights between Perth and Adelaide/Brisbane/Canberra/Darwin/Melbourne/Sydney, complimentary beer and wine is served on departures after midday every day, and selected QantasLink Jet and Turboprop services have complimentary beer and wine from mid-afternoon every day.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">While we have no plans to change this offering at the present time, your comments have been forwarded to our Food and Beverage Management to be used in future reviews of this policy.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We appreciate you taking the time to bring this matter to our attention and hope that we have an opportunity to welcome you aboard Qantas again in the future.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>